		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour</p><p>code qui marche :<br />$link = pg_Connect(&quot;host=localhost dbname=... user=... password=&#039;...&#039;&quot;);<br />$res = pg_query($link, &quot;select miniature&#160; from photo &quot;);<br />$numrows = pg_numrows($res);<br />for($ri = 0; $ri &lt; $numrows; $ri++) {<br />$row = pg_fetch_array($res, $ri);<br />$img =&#160; pg_unescape_bytea($row[&#039;miniature&#039;]);<br />$fln = &quot;toto&quot;.$ri.&quot;.jpeg&quot;;<br />file_put_contents($fln, $img);<br />echo &quot;&lt;img src=&#039;&quot;.$fln.&quot;&#039;/&gt;&quot;;<br />}</p><p>Comment se passer du fichier intermédiaire $fln ?</p><p>Merci</p>]]></content>
